      <change>normalize_identifiers.py - period replaced with underscore in every USLM path segment</change>
      <change>the period is reserved in USLM for the manifestation suffix, so a segment such as mco/1050.3j is ambiguous against the published grammar</change>
      <change>underscore is drawn from the RFC 3986 unreserved set, which the USLM 2.1 Review Guide already requires for version strings</change>
      <change>19 identifier(s) rewritten in this record</change>
      <change>document id, native number, and displayed text are unchanged</change>
